From 83d548ae36470aa5db6646f3a6b7c9851843cfd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <05jeelo30@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:51:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] base: Add PropImitationHooks for Play Integrity and Google
 Photos

Report a certified build to Play Services (the unstable process) and the
Play Store, and a Pixel to Google Photos, by overriding the Build fields
when the app starts. In the spoofed processes, key attestation requested
by Play Integrity (DroidGuard) is blocked, so it falls back to the
spoofed properties.

The certified properties come from Settings.Secure.certified_props_data
as JSON, set by the Spoofify app. spoof_props and spoof_google_photos
turn each part off.

Based on PropImitationHooks from Paranoid Android, ArrowOS and
LibreMobileOS, as carried in AdarshGrewal/android_vendor_extra, without
the keybox spoofing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
